{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2025-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1743465600, "end_date": 1744070399, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:01:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "192251817", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087387454", "personaname": "Dr4nn0c", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198087387454/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1443, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1443, "last_played": 1701540838, "avatar": "bd4e61074e715bfde31850b5e887f42d040fac9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I will say the exact same things haters said. The game has no real story, everything is repetitive and rushed. The game tries but never succeeds. They took the appearance of ME (the real games) and took off all the stuff that made the games the best every been.\nYou will do the same missions on each planet, and you will have just the illusion of keeping relationship wiith npcs.\n\nTo sum up : no story, no real choices to make, no relationship with npcs, no innovation. Don't waste your time, just wait your brain to forget the ME trilogy, and go back to them. Much better.\n\nI managed to play 25hrs, but it was only because it was ME universe, and the graphics are somehow interesting. Thats the only two positive points of the game.", "timestamp_created": 1744064135, "timestamp_updated": 1744064135, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 31, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.679862678050994873", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 8, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "192228600", "author": {"steamid": "76561198276677728", "personaname": "donohoed", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198276677728/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7878, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1490, "last_played": 1746762298, "avatar": "b331eecb5a6494dedce1f093aa6e3ab82b9b0794"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can't recommend any game that has to go through the EA launcher. Internet is down and can't even play single player games to pass the time because the launcher won't allow it without an internet connection. If they ever scrap the EA launcher, then maybe I could recommend the game. Until then, don't waste your time with anything this company puts out.", "timestamp_created": 1744042108, "timestamp_updated": 1744042108, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.493558406829833984", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "192203713", "author": {"steamid": "76561198107471591", "personaname": "Azrael Noobslayer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198107471591/", "num_games_owned": 798, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 2160, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1854, "last_played": 1750078134, "avatar": "3c1a325b88d6e8d315e03ad7d1165d71efc0f5b9"}, "language": "english", "review": "As mass effect fan i am not recommending this game. Gameplay is fun 4/5 (some mechanics copied from Dragon age inquisition) sometimes it went to repetative things, but thanks god at the end developers excluded additional steps for it. Combat is 5/5 i couldnt wait to fight with someone weapons are greatly designed. New species boring. new humanoid race with different colour 2/5. Main story is rubbish actually it is main reasoun i put dislike to the game.", "timestamp_c